          "original": "The H230 sample exhibits severe cracking with a crack density of 2.81 mm/mm²... After HIP heat treatment, the cracks in H230 are completely annihilated... granular precipitated phases with an average size of 1.3±0.2μm and 0.45±0.05μm, are distributed at grain boundaries and grains interior... the phases distributed at intragranular and intergranular are both W-rich M6C carbides... The number densities of carbides in H230... was 0.52 μm⁻²... The average grain sizes of H230... after heat treatment was 13.2 μm.",
